/-- Unit multiplier on a repeated zero Blaschke block has vanishing finite residual on every
filter.  This is a nondegenerate-filter instance of the packet convergence interface. -/
theorem finiteBoundaryScalingPacket_residualTendsToZero_one_repeatSingle
    {ι : Type*} (l : Filter ι) (m : ℕ) :
